      "full_page": "\"THANK GOD NOW, AHEAD OF TIME, FOR ALL THAT IS COMING TO US. INCLUDE OUR DEATHS WITH ALL THE CIRCUMSTANCES CONNECTED WITH THEM. (DEATH IS THE CLIMAX OF ALL HUMILIATION, WHEN WE MUST FINALLY GIVE UP ALL, AND TURN ALL OVER TO GOD. DEATH CAN BE VERY BEAUTIFUL -- LIKE A WEDDING, IF WE MAKE IT SO. DEATH IS STILL BETTER WHEN WE ARE CONSCIOUS, AND KNOW.\"",
