      "rid": "doc_2.src_content.0",
      "doc": "doc_2",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Many thanks and God's blessing to every associate and to every associate's every neighbor. May the Holy Ghost teach us all something at least of appreciation - of gratitude - for the inestimable privilege of serv- ing God and saving our own immortal souls by helping one another! This incidently we might add, according to the definition of religion, rather say, in harmony with \"Religion; the Science of our supremely privileged, happy dependence on Almighty God and our neighbor\" (each rational creature being its own first neighbor). The definition holds for every rational creature - alike in Heaven, on Earth and in Purgatory; not in Hell, because they are not rational there, the acknow- ledged headquarters of atheism. Atheism? \"The unqualified climax at once of in- tellectual insanity, of moral degeneresy, diabolical blasphemy.",
